OL,13,G2000 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,14,     FA pair of pups drive their owners
OL,15,     Fto distraction whenever they hit
OL,16,     Fthe road. And a salon dog gives a
OL,17,     Fhair-raising send-off whenever
OL,18,     Fclients depart. Can Graeme Hall
OL,19,     Fsave the day?
